\v 25 Now concerning¦115665 unmarried women, I¦115672 don't¦115671 have¦115672 instructions¦115669 from \nd Yahweh¦115670\nd* but¦115674 I'll¦115675 give¦115675 \add &my\add* \add #opinions¦115673\add* as¦115676 someone who's trustworthy¦115680 thanks to¦115681 \nd Yahweh's\nd* mercy¦115677.
