\v 26 Therefore¦115683, I¦115682 think¦115682 it's¦115692 good¦115685 because¦115687 of¦115687 the¦115688 distress that's¦115691 about to¦115696 come, that \add #people¦115693\add* should stay as \add #they\add* are¦115696 \add currently\add*.
\v 27 If you're¦115697 married, then don't¦115699 try¦115700 to get out of it. If you're¦115702 not¦115705 committed, don't look¦115706 for a¦115707 spouse.
\v 28 But¦115709 if a single guy or single girl get married, that's not a sin, but¦115723 they'll \add likely\add* face difficult circumstances and¦115730 I'm¦115729 trying to spare¦115732 you from that.
