\v 15 But¦116522 I¦116521 haven't \add ≈taken advantage of\add* \add any\add* of those¦116527 rights, and¦116530 even \add now\add*, I'm¦116529 not writing¦116529 this to ask for¦116538 material support for¦116539 myself—I'd rather¦116540 die¦116541 than¦116544 have someone¦116548 deprive me of this reason for boasting¦116546.
